  <p id="c-songshu-060-fantai:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-060-fantai:p001:m0000" ref="ffc_ea1_a8f_A">范泰</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-060-fantai:p001:m0003" ref="ffc_ea1_a8f_A">伯倫</persName>，順陽山陰人也。祖<persName id="c-songshu-060-fantai:p001:m0014" ref="ae7_dcf_084">汪</persName>，晉安北將軍、徐兗二州刺史。父<persName id="c-songshu-060-fantai:p001:m0030" ref="ffc_ea1_a8f">甯</persName>，豫章太守。</p>
